<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>재고 관리 | 앙사모 ERP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/common.css?v=20260804-4"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/material.css"></head><body><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/views/common/sidebar.jsp"/><div class="app-shell"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/views/common/header.jsp"/><main class="workspace"><section class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">INVENTORY</p><h1>재고 관리</h1><p>입고 검수에서 정상 판정된 수량만 자동 반영된 현재 재고입니다.</p></div></section><section class="notice"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">verified</span><p>재고는 입고 검수 완료 시 자동으로 증가합니다. 임의 수량 변경은 제공하지 않습니다.</p></section><section class="panel table-panel"><div class="panel-header"><h2>품목별 재고</h2><span class="list-count">${inventory.size()}개 품목</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>품목코드</th><th>품목명</th><th>기준수량</th><th>가용수량</th><th>산출수량</th><th>재고금액</th><th>출고준비</th><th>갱신일</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${inventory}" var="row"><tr><td>${row.itemCode}</td><td>${row.itemName}</td><td>${row.baseQty}</td><td><strong>${row.availableQty}</strong></td><td>${row.calcQty}</td><td>${row.stockValue}</td><td>${row.releaseReadyStatus}</td><td>${row.updatedAt}</td></tr></c:forEach><c:if test="${empty inventory}"><tr><td colspan="8" class="empty-cell">재고가 없습니다.</td></tr></c:if></tbody></table></div></section></main></div><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/js/common.js?v=20260804-5"></script></body></html>
